        rdfs:comment                   "Man's night cap, 1650-80, French; canvas embroidered with silk and metal thread"@en , "Man’s night cap made of coarse canvas, embroidered with green, blue, white, red and tawny silk floss and silver filé, in tent and running stitches, in a pattern of leaves and pomegranates.  The cap is cut in one piece with a brim and 4 shaped sections, and lined with coarse linen."@en ;
